{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261110/photo/bkn-20261110174220983-1110_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261110182633\"/><p>受傷剷車司機送院治療。(陳嘉傑攝)</p><p>今午(10日)5時27分，葵涌貨櫃碼頭南路18號一物流中心，一輛剷車於鐵板平台上失事，跌落約1.3米下的路面，65歲司機頭部受傷被困。消防到場把司機救出，清醒被送往瑪嘉烈醫院治療，警員正調查意外原因。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.901168+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":126,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T09:42:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:14:29.796194+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:56.856404+00:00","content_hash":"a63de41dc8cbcf24f53052b5af5998e713ba2ec79de4f3e78cfe5548c82ce3fb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.901168+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}